SUMMARY:UCL East Volunteering Fair
LOCATION:Marshgate Building\, UCL East Campus
DESCRIPTION:UCL East Marshgate Volunteering Fair 2026\nDiscover ways to mak
 e a difference! Book a ticket to secure your space!\nJoin us at UCL’s Vo
 lunteering Fair 2026 to:\nMeet recruiters from a wide range of UK-based ch
 arities and non-profits\nExplore diverse volunteering roles\, from one-off
  events to long-term placements\nDiscover how you can make a meaningful di
 fference in London and beyond\nConnect with passionate students and profes
 sionals working in the social impact space\nBenefits of Volunteering\nVolu
 nteering can support you to\nMake new friends\nBuild skills\nBoost your CV
 \nImprove your wellbeing\nBe part of something different\n“I don’t hav
 e anyone to go with…”\nTotally fine! You’ll be warmly welcomed by so
 meone from our friendly team\, who’ll help orient you in the space and i
 ntroduce you to others. We’re always there to make sure the fair feels f
 un\, inclusive\, and supportive\,  whether you come solo or with friends.
 \nWe get that coming alone takes a bit of courage. If you’d like to chat
  things through beforehand\, one of our student team members can give you 
 an honest\, informal insight into what to expect. Just drop us an email:\n
 📩\n[email protected]\nLet’s make 2026 the year you try something new
 \, meet new people\, and create social impact!\n\nOrganised by UCL Student
  Social Impact.
URL:https://studentsunionucl.org/whats-on/volunteering/ucl-east-volunteerin
 g-fair-0?v=95152
END:VEVENT
